From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Kiernan <alex.kiernan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] adbd: build against kernel headers older than 5.6

VMADDR_CID_LOCAL arrived in the 5.6 headers. Its value is the kernel's
ABI, 1, and an older kernel never reports that CID, so where the headers
lack it adbd's local-connection check is unchanged by defining it.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [kernels older than 5.6]

AI-Generated: Claude Opus 5.5 (Claude Code)
Signed-off-by: Alex Kiernan <alex.kiernan@gmail.com>
---
--- a/packages/modules/adb/daemon/transport_socket_server.cpp
+++ b/packages/modules/adb/daemon/transport_socket_server.cpp
@@ -54,6 +54,10 @@
 #include "socket_spec.h"
 #include "sysdeps/chrono.h"
 
+#ifndef VMADDR_CID_LOCAL
+#define VMADDR_CID_LOCAL 1
+#endif
+
 static bool should_check_vsock_cid() {
 #if defined(__ANDROID__) && !defined(__ANDROID_RECOVERY__)
     return com_android_adbd_flags_adbd_restrict_vsock_local_cid();
